with Yanis Varoufakis, who is the former finance

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:09.540
minister of Greece, professor of economics
at the University of Athens.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.250
Co-Founder of the International Grassroots
Movement.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:17.900
And also author of several books including
most recently, another now dispatches from

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.640
an Alternative Present.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.640
Great to have you today.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.869
I appreciate it.

00:00:21.869 --> 00:00:23.369
Thank you, David.

00:00:23.369 --> 00:00:24.380
